<title>ROMANIA: Bucharest bourse prices up, turnover down. [CORRECTED 17:59 GMT]</title>
<headline>Bucharest bourse prices up, turnover down. [CORRECTED 17:59 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>1545 GMT - Prices on the Bucharest bourse continued to edge up in the second session of the exchange this year.</p>
<p>* However, trading was thin with turnover dropping to 16.9 million lei, about one quarter of the previous session level.</p>
